rectangle "A positive selling price and a snapshot are saved atomically.\nUnavailable items are missing items, never zero-cost products.\nComparisons are queries: no comparison command or persisted event.\nA substitute suggestion does not replace a Shopping Planning item." as rules <<Business Rule>> #FFF1AE
